   "longitude": "-124.02315393383401",
   "latLong": "{lat:41.3638220800563, lng:-124.02315393383401}",
   "audioDescription": "Historic 1930's building that looks like a cabin. It is single story and set in front of towering redwood trees. Porch and steps/ramp in front. RV and trailer parking is not available at this visitor center, but outside of this area 100-400 feet from the building on the Newton B. Drury Scenic Parkway. Picnic tables, interpretive panels, trail-head information, and water faucet.",
